Summary
I am a Computer Science enthusiast with a strong focus on web
development, programming, and networking. I am committed to
designing clean, efficient, and well-structured digital solutions while
continuously enhancing my technical expertise.
My technical skill set includes HTML, CSS, JavaScript (basic), and
C programming, along with foundational knowledge of computer
networking using tools such as Cisco Packet Tracer. I am particularly
interested in building reliable web interfaces and understanding
system-level concepts that support scalable applications.
I actively seek opportunities to apply my skills through practical
projects and freelance work, with the goal of gaining real-world
experience and contributing value through technology-driven
solutions.
